---
interface Props { daySrc: string; duskSrc: string; }
const { daySrc, duskSrc } = Astro.props;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="derinlik" class="motion-lab ml-facade" data-motion-facade data-testid="motion-facade"
  data-scene="day" data-motion="false" aria-labelledby="ml-facade-title">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="ml-facade-heading">
      <div><p class="t-tech ml-label">C / Işık ve perspektif</p><h2 id="ml-facade-title" class="t-display-l">Aynı cephe.<br />Başka bir his.</h2></div>
      <p class="ml-description">Gün ışığından mavi saate geçin. Perspektifi ve derinliği değiştirin; isterseniz sahneyi imlece ve kaydırmaya bağlayın.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ml-facade-layout">
      <div class="ml-facade-viewport" data-facade-viewport data-testid="facade-viewport">
        <div class="ml-facade-gridlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ml-facade-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src={daySrc} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1086" height="1448" data-facade-backdrop />
        </div>
        <div class="ml-facade-camera" data-facade-camera>
          <div class="ml-facade-mat" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="ml-facade-image-plane">
            <img src={daySrc} alt="El Ele Apartmanı cephesinin mevcut temsilî gündüz görseli"
              width="1086" height="1448" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-facade-day data-testid="facade-day-image" />
            <img src={duskSrc} alt="Aynı cephe için yapay zekâ ile hazırlanan, sıcak pencere ışıklı mavi saat konsepti"
              width="1086" height="1448" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-facade-dusk data-testid="facade-dusk-image" aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <div class="ml-facade-survey" aria-hidden="true">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
            <span class="ml-facade-survey-top t-tech">EL ELE / CEPHE ÇALIŞMASI</span>
            <span class="ml-facade-survey-bottom t-tech" data-facade-scene-tag>01 — GÜN IŞIĞI</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-facade-stage-label"><span class="t-tech">PENDİK / İSTANBUL</span><span class="t-tech" data-facade-motion-label>SABİT PERSPEKTİF</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ml-facade-panel">
        <p class="t-tech ml-label">Mimari portföy / 01</p>
        <h3>El Ele Apartmanı</h3>
        <p class="ml-description">Beyaz cephe, koyu korkuluklar ve tekrar eden balkon çizgileri. Sahneyi değiştirirken aynı yapının karakterini karşılaştırın.</p>
        <div class="ml-controls ml-facade-controls">
          <div class="ml-facade-scene-picker" role="group" aria-label="Cephe ışığı">
            <button type="button" class="ml-button" aria-pressed="true" data-facade-scene="day" data-testid="facade-day"><span aria-hidden="true">☀</span> Gün ışığı</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-button" aria-pressed="false" data-facade-scene="dusk" data-testid="facade-dusk"><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span> Mavi saat</button>
          </div>
          <label class="ml-range-group">
            <span class="ml-range-label"><span>Derinlik etkisi</span><output data-facade-depth-output>55%</output></span>
            <input type="range" class="ml-range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="55" aria-label="Cephe derinlik etkisi" data-facade-depth data-testid="facade-depth" />
          </label>
          <label class="ml-range-group">
            <span class="ml-range-label"><span>Yatay bakış</span><output data-facade-angle-output>0°</output></span>
            <input type="range" class="ml-range" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0" aria-label="Cephe bakış açısı" data-facade-angle data-testid="facade-angle" />
          </label>
          <div class="ml-buttons">
            <button type="button" class="ml-button" data-facade-motion-toggle data-testid="facade-motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Hareketi aç</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-button" data-facade-reset data-testid="facade-reset">Sıfırla</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="ml-facade-status" role="status" data-facade-status>Gün ışığı: mevcut temsilî proje görseli.</p>
        <p class="ml-note">Görseller temsilîdir. Mavi saat, yapay zekâ ile üretilmiş bir ışık fikridir; gerçek aydınlatma uygulamasını veya teslim kapsamını göstermez. Perspektif etkisi, görsel katmanlardan oluşur.</p>
        <a class="ml-facade-project-link" href={base + '/projeler/el-ele-apartmani/'}>Proje detayını incele <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <noscript><p class="ml-noscript">Gündüz görünümü gösteriliyor. Işık seçimi ve hareket kontrolleri için JavaScript gereklidir.</p></noscript>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initFacadeDepth } from './facade';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-motion-facade]').forEach(initFacadeDepth);
</script>

<style>
  .ml-facade { padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .ml-facade-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; margin-block-end: 2.5rem; }
  .ml-facade-heading h2 { margin-block-start: 0.7rem; line-height: 1.1; }
  .ml-facade-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .ml-facade-viewport { position: relative; min-width: 0; height: 700px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--ml-border); background: var(--color-night-800); perspective: 1500px; isolation: isolate; }
  .ml-facade-gridlines { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.22; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(73 193 198 / 0.22) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgb(73 193 198 / 0.22) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px; }
  .ml-facade-backdrop { position: absolute; inset: -20%; opacity: 0.12; filter: blur(22px); transform: translate3d(var(--ml-backdrop-x, 0px), var(--ml-backdrop-y, 0px), 0); }
  .ml-facade-backdrop img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ml-facade-camera { --ml-depth: 0.55; position: absolute; width: min(68%, 432px); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(var(--ml-scroll-y, 0px)) rotateX(var(--ml-tilt-x, 0deg)) rotateY(var(--ml-tilt-y, 0deg)); }
  .ml-facade-mat { position: absolute; inset: -18px; border: 1px solid rgb(244 244 242 / 0.18); background: rgb(14 15 17 / 0.5); transform: translateZ(calc(var(--ml-depth) * -55px)); }
  .ml-facade-image-plane { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform: translateZ(calc(var(--ml-depth) * 24px)); }
  .ml-facade-image-plane img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  [data-facade-dusk] { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 650ms ease; }
  [data-scene='dusk'] [data-facade-dusk] { opacity: 1; }
  .ml-facade-survey { position: absolute; inset: -10px; pointer-events: none; transform: translateZ(calc(var(--ml-depth) * 65px)); }
  .ml-facade-survey i { position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-color: var(--color-mey-teal); }
  .ml-facade-survey i:nth-child(1) { inset-inline-start: 0; top: 0; border-inline-start: 1px solid; border-block-start: 1px solid; }
  .ml-facade-survey i:nth-child(2) { inset-inline-end: 0; top: 0; border-inline-end: 1px solid; border-block-start: 1px solid; }
  .ml-facade-survey i:nth-child(3) { inset-inline-start: 0; bottom: 0; border-inline-start: 1px solid; border-block-end: 1px solid; }
  .ml-facade-survey i:nth-child(4) { inset-inline-end: 0; bottom: 0; border-inline-end: 1px solid; border-block-end: 1px solid; }
  .ml-facade-survey-top, .ml-facade-survey-bottom { position: absolute; inset-inline-start: 0; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--color-concrete-050); background: var(--color-night-950); padding: 0.3rem 0.45rem; }
  .ml-facade-survey-top { top: -29px; }
  .ml-facade-survey-bottom { bottom: -29px; }
  .ml-facade-stage-label { position: absolute; inset-inline: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--ml-muted); }
  .ml-facade-stage-label .t-tech { font-size: 0.625rem; }
  .ml-facade-panel h3 { margin-block: 0.8rem; font: 600 clamp(1.6rem, 2.7vw, 2.3rem)/1.1 var(--font-display); }
  .ml-facade-panel .ml-description { font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .ml-facade-controls { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 1.3rem; margin-block: 1.75rem; }
  .ml-facade-scene-picker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .ml-facade-scene-picker .ml-button { gap: 0.6rem; }
  .ml-facade-scene-picker .ml-button span { font-size: 1.125rem; }
  .ml-facade-status { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ml-muted); min-height: 3rem; margin-block-end: 1rem; }
  .ml-facade-project-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-concrete-050); border-block-end: 1px solid var(--color-red-on-dark); padding-block: 0.6rem; margin-block-start: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 1099px) {
    .ml-facade-layout { gap: 2rem; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; }
    .ml-facade-viewport { height: 600px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 799px) {
    .ml-facade-heading, .ml-facade-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ml-facade-heading { gap: 1.1rem; }
    .ml-facade-viewport { height: clamp(400px, 100vw, 650px); }
    .ml-facade-camera { width: 66%; max-width: 390px; }
    .ml-facade-survey-top, .ml-facade-survey-bottom { inset-inline-start: 10px; }
    .ml-facade-survey-top { top: 10px; }
    .ml-facade-survey-bottom { bottom: 10px; }
    .ml-facade-panel { max-width: 600px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 399px) {
    .ml-facade-viewport { height: 380px; }
    .ml-facade-survey-top, .ml-facade-survey-bottom { font-size: 0.5rem; }
    .ml-facade-stage-label .t-tech { font-size: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
